{"id":"chyort","lemma":"чёрт","pos":"noun","rank":257,"glosses":["devil, demon","Used as an intensifier in phrases grammatically requiring a noun; hell"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/43/Ru-%D1%87%D1%91%D1%80%D1%82.ogg/Ru-%D1%87%D1%91%D1%80%D1%82.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"чёрта","plural":"черти","feminine":"чертовка"},"examples":[{"text":"Что ты делаешь, чёрт возьми?","en":"What on earth are you doing?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/655492","words":[{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"делать"},null,{"g":"to take","l":"взять"}]},{"text":"Где ты, чёрт возьми, это взял?","en":"Where on earth did you get it?","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"to take","l":"взять"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to take","l":"взять"}]},{"text":"Что вы, чёрт возьми, тут делаете?","en":"Why on earth are you here?","words":[{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},null,{"g":"to take","l":"взять"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"делать"}]},{"text":"Мы у чёрта на куличках.","en":"We're in the middle of nowhere.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"at / by"},null,{"g":"on / at"},null]},{"text":"Мой друг живёт чёрт-те где.","en":"My friend lives in the middle of nowhere.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"close friend"},{"g":"to live","l":"жить"},null,{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"where"}]}]}